# =========================================================
# .NET Build Outputs (gateway/, tools/)
# 1,104 of these were tracked — 127 under obj/ and 977 under bin/, 11 MB
# including compiled .dll and .exe. They regenerate on every `dotnet build`, so
# a clean checkout reported them as modified and every agent started in a dirty
# tree it was instructed not to touch. Nothing consumes them: gateway:build,
# gateway:test and gateway:package all build from source.
# scripts/validate-framework.mjs now fails if tracked build output returns.
# =========================================================
gateway/**/bin/
gateway/**/obj/
tools/**/bin/
tools/**/obj/

